    "sections": {
        "description": "<p><iframe loading=\"lazy\" title=\"Boost Your Jewelry Sales: The Ring Filter &amp; Search App for Shopify &amp; WooCommerce!\" width=\"750\" height=\"422\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/gn6NZVnBCuI?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe></p>\n<p>Keyideas is a pioneer in jewelry solutions, offering a specialized app tailored for jewelry website owners. This innovative tool empowers WooCommerce store owners to seamlessly integrate a full-scale ring-building experience on their sites. By enhancing customer engagement and driving a substantial 30% increase in sales, this integration solidifies jewelry retailers&#8217; leadership in online customization trends. Join the forefront of industry innovation and elevate your sales today with Keyideas!</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Advanced Filter to Match Your Engagement and Wedding Ring Collection</li>\n<li>Custom Filters: Metal, Ring Style, Diamond Shape, Accents, Gender, Bridal Set</li>\n<li>Global Ring Sizing, Engraving, and Multilingual Support</li>\n</ol>\n<h3>Third-Party Libraries</h3>\n<p>This plugin includes the following third-party libraries:</p>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>v1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>v1.0.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>UI and performance updates with few bug fixes.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>v1.1.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Theme updated and attributes mapping support added</li>\n<li>Major bug fixes</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>v1.2.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Introduced a new, more stable theme with enhanced accessibility and an improved user interface and experience (UI/UX).</li>\n<li>Implemented numerous major and minor bug fixes for greater overall stability.</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
